OL,3,GNEWSAMajor unit takes over inquiries
OL,4,Ainto police video
OL,5,
OL,6,FInquiries into why police failed to
OL,7,Fhand over body-worn video of an arrest
OL,8,Fhave been taken over by the Independent
OL,9,FOffice for Police Conduct's (IOPC)
OL,10,Fmajor investigations unit.
OL,12,FNadine Buzzard-Quashie alleges her face
OL,13,Fwas shoved into stinging nettles by
OL,14,FNorthamptonshire Police officers who
OL,15,Fstopped her car in September 2021.
OL,17,FA legal battle to obtain footage of the
OL,18,Fincident resulted in the force being
OL,19,Ffined #50,000 for withholding it.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
